          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-charcoal-900 mb-2">Collect Oil</h3>
          <p class="text-steel-600">Pure, filtered oil flows out through the slotted barrel while the compressed seed cake is ejected automatically by the 4-hook mechanism.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

