          <div class="text-amber-500 font-semibold text-sm mt-3">Yield: 30-40%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-steel-100">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">&#127803;</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-charcoal-900 mb-2">Sunflower Oil</h3>
          <p class="text-steel-600 text-sm">Eastern Europe and Africa staple cooking oil. High smoke point and mild flavor make it a versatile choice for both home and commercial food production.</p>
          <div class="text-amber-500 font-semibold text-sm mt-3">Yield: 40-48%</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Technical Comparison -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="section-title text-center mb-12">Technical Comparison</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-steel-900 text-white">
